# The Emscripten build output stays in git for day-to-day development, but it is left out of
# `git archive`, which is how the AMO source package is made. The source package then holds only
# human-written code, and `npm run build-for-amo` rebuilds these two files from pinned source with
# scripts/build-wasm.sh.
vendor/beldex-app-bridge/BeldexLibAppCpp_WASM.js export-ignore
vendor/beldex-app-bridge/BeldexLibAppCpp_WASM.wasm export-ignore
